      <div type="clause" n="Inscr.">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IAtr">I Atr</ref> Inscr.</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="I Atr. Inscr." corresp="#wit-h">Æþelredes cyninges gerædnisse.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="I Atr. Inscr." corresp="#wit-b">Æðelredes lage.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-b">Æðelredes lage</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-b">Æthelred's laws.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">König Aethelreds Verordnungen (Recht B).</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">King Æthelred's ordinances (law, B).</ab>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#wormald-ppmel" n="239"><ref target="clause:IIIAtr_Prol">III Atr</ref></note>
        <note type="editorial">K: checked against Gesetze I p. ; Base text K = H (Textus Roffensis f. 46, after II Em, c. 1125); N = B (CCCC 383 f. 3, after Hundred, c. 1125, compared with Ld); O = Quadripartitus (after ‘Wer’ in T, after ‘Ordal’ in MHkBr). Code issued at Woodstock, 980–1013. Heading in red in H and B.</note>
      </div>
